{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And of Gad he said</b> In his blessing of Gad you find every letter of the alphabet. Because Moses our Teacher is buried in his portion, who fulfilled the entire Torah from <b>alef</b> to <b>tav</b>. And so in the blessing of Joseph. Because Joseph's coffin traveled alongside the Ark, to say: this one fulfilled what is written in that one:" "<b>and tore</b> Two times: וטרף זרוע · אשר אם עבר ורמס וטרף ואין מציל. To say: whatever he tore, none delivers from his hand:" "<b>Naphtali, satisfaction</b> ר\"ת (initial letters) form נשר (eagle). For he was swift as an eagle to do the will of his Father in heaven:"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:28.915170545Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}